            "paragraph": "The unusual extent and duration of the melting are linked to strong and sustained advection of warm marine air toward the area, likely favoured by the concurrent strong El Ni\u00f1o event. The increase in the number of extreme El Ni\u00f1o events projected for the twenty-first century could expose the WAIS to more frequent major melt events.",
